## Do

- Reuse stores, design tokens, and existing sheet/button patterns.
- Keep dictionary local-first; AI is optional enrichment.
- Put new `@AppStorage` keys in `AppStorageKeys`.
- Leave worker CEFR/script prompt rules intact unless the task is explicitly about them.
- Home: one lesson hero (`DailyLessonCard`); due reviews live inside the lesson queue.
- Green Owl only: white pages (`appBg`), gray blocks (`cardBg` `#F7F7F7`), `duo3DStyle` CTAs, `cardRadius`/`chipRadius`. No gray stroke borders on Duo cards.
- Practice correct/wrong = toast greens/reds (`successStrong` / `errorStrong` → `accentGreen` / `accentRed`).
- Empty states: tip + strong Add CTA (`EmptyListView` / `PracticeEmptyContent`).
- Scan: photo only; long Share → extract-words. Dedup against dictionary. No clipboard-paste extract on Add.
- Language picker flags are illustrated (`LanguageFlagView`). Page dots are `PageCapsules`.
- App Customization icons come from `AppIconStyle.customizationCases` (no language/flag icons — those are removed from the product). Tab bar artwork lives in `MenuBarIcons`; the rest of the app uses SF Symbols.
- Opening the app clears the icon badge (`NotificationManager.clearBadge` on scene `.active`).
- Dictionary: reaction emoji chips after tags filter cards; search matches reactions. Circles use `DesignChip` (same size on cards).
- Practice results hide the tab bar; restore on close / new round.
- Tab bar: system height (`.tabBarMinimizeBehavior(.never)`, no `sizeThatFits` shrink).
- Before a push: update `AGENTS.md` and `README.md` if behavior or the map changed, delete code comments, then push.
- New UI copy: translate into all catalog locales in `Localizable.xcstrings`; plurals need correct number/declension (see `localization.mdc`).
- Large soft-cover / empty-state heroes use `themeStore.iconAccent`. Small settings/menu icons keep `mainText` or rainbow `icon*` tokens. Soft-cover: centered content, bottom CTAs. CTAs stay `mainAccentColor`; delete stays red; Home PRO sparkle stays `accentBlue`.

## Don't

- Leave code comments. No `//`, `///`, or block comments in Swift, the worker, or scripts. Names and structure should be clear without them.
- Commit secrets (`.dev.vars`, API keys).
- Dump Practice quiz UI or a second review CTA onto Home.
- Apply Duo gray card surfaces to non-`.duolingo` themes.
- Delete `WordsICloudSync` when disabling iCloud — keep entitlements on; only comment them temporarily if the user asks for a Personal Team device run.
- Flip `FeatureGates.streakEnabled` or `homeChatEnabled` on unless the user asks.
- Touch `droword-worker/node_modules` or invent parallel persistence next to `WordsStore`.
- Bring language/flag app icons back, or replace tab-bar symbols with custom art unless asked.
- Shrink the tab bar in `sizeThatFits` or turn minimize back on.
- Add a zero-distance drag on language cards (it blocks scroll) or pulse the PRO sparkle (`ProPillBadge`, `ProPlusMark` stay static). Home PRO stays a plain `accentBlue` sparkle. Only the paywall plaque is themed.
- Open the theme picker on the first palette. It stays on the saved theme (`showPager` after the selection is set).
- Replace empty-state halos (`text.badge.plus`, dictionary `textformat`, practice `bolt`, tag `tag`) with custom drawings.
- Rewrite `NotificationCopy` from old English slang. Russian is the source of meaning.
- Highlight irregular forms outside the example sentence. `forms` / `POST /forms` feed `HighlightedExample` only.
